# Baseline .config fragment for Xiaomi CR8806 (256m group)
#
# This is a FRAGMENT, not a full .config. The workflow copies it to .config
# and runs `make defconfig`, which expands it against the kuncy7 tree
# (openwrt-nss-edma, branch c3po-tag-8021q, kernel 6.18).
#
# Symbol names below come from the project research report (base-source
# recommendation section). The workflow greps the expanded .config after
# defconfig and fails the build if a required symbol was dropped, so a
# wrong symbol name fails loudly instead of silently producing a
# non-NSS image.
#
# Device: Xiaomi CR8806, M79 board revision, IPQ5018 + QCN6122 + QCA8337,
# 256 MB RAM -> 256m group: ath11k 256M profile, NSS low memory profile.
# This is the A版 M79 configuration; the A版 M81 variant is
# configs/cr8808-m81-256m.config (its board data comes from the
# files-xiaomi_cr8808/ overlay, not from an ipq-wifi package).
# Linux sees about 169 MiB on this board with 20-30 MiB free at idle,
# so keep the package set small.

# Target: qualcommax/ipq50xx, device profile xiaomi_cr8806
CONFIG_TARGET_qualcommax_ipq50xx_DEVICE_xiaomi_cr8806=y
